  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::MadeInArizona.MissionDefinition
  id: mine
  title: 11. A Very Large Cooling Problem
  region: Open Invoice Mine
  briefing: Disable the mining foreman's landship. Shoot its exposed cooling, weapon
    and generator pods to weaken the machine, then destroy the chassis and recover
    its control key.
  opening: 'Ellis: That haul truck is wearing the cooling plant. Mara: Good. I was
    worried this would be a normal-sized radiator job.'
  midpoint: 'Mara: Hit the external pods. Weapon power, cooling and generator are
    separate systems. Somebody left the service access exposed.'
  closing: 'Mara: We shut it down. The corporate app still says the technician is
    arriving between eight and five.'
  optionalObjective: Keep at least 45% chassis health
  contentOrder: 10
  reward: 2500
  enemyCount: 8
  targetCount: 1
  timeLimit: 600
  objectiveDuration: 45
  mode: 6
  optionalKind: 1
  optionalThreshold: 0.45
